  "_about": "a red squirrel SCULPTED on its rig (2026-11-05, gen: scratchpad sc/carn/gen/small.py): 20 cm head-body, the great brush of a tail curled up over its back, tufted ears, big dark eyes in a pale ring, a white belly and chin; long hind feet, small clever hands (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): upright cupped sheets with round tips (sharp.js `fin`), pale in the hollow; the roots faired. The red squirrel's TUFTS (`tufts`; 2026-11-08 evening -- before, one thin horn standing up behind each ear): a BUSHY BRUSH of 31 hair strands an ear (horn `strand`s, the whiskers' kind) rooted ON the ear -- along both edges of its upper rim, over the tip, and densely on both faces round the tip -- fanning out ~30 degrees either way in the ear's plane and ~18 across it, of varied lengths, rising ~0.45 of the ear's length over the tip; a short fat `horn` core at the tip (the far mesh's dark tip); the ear's back colour darkening (`tuftE`) toward the ends. The grey squirrel has none.",
